lse-positive success. No dedicated upload tool was available in the loaded 'core' MCP profile (a 'debug' profile advertises upload tools but wasn't active and ToolSearch couldn't surface it). Had to work around this by using agent_browser_eval to read the file's bytes (via Bash base64), construct a File object in-page, and assign it to the input via a DataTransfer object — this is a non-obvious, code-level workaround that a typical user of the tool wouldn't discover without deep debugging.","bottlenecks":"Diagnosing the fill/file-input failure took several verification round-trips (fill -> eval-check files.length) before concluding the tool was broken for this case rather than user error. Once the DataTransfer workaround was found, the rest (submit, wait for preview, confirm) was fast and worked on the first try via snapshot refs."},"transcript":"benchmarks/results/transcripts/cg-agent-browser-documents-1-1788919668182.json"}
